    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>&nbsp;On January 31, 2017, the company awarded a SAR 13 million construction contract to First Technical Contracting Co. to build the warehouse.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>&nbsp;The company announced that the project is expected to be completed in December 2017.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>&nbsp;By end of 2017, the company announced completion of the warehouse construction and commencement of operations.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
